    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "one more thing... do you think there's any chance of getting a \"bad\" piece of wood that looks totally fine on the surface but's actually structurally unsound due to something deep inside? like, how do I know if there's some kind of invisible defect or something that's just lurking in the center of the beam that's gonna cause trouble down the line?",
